  "id": "balance-theory",
  "term": "balance theory",
  "definition": "Balance theory is a social-network idea that focuses on relationships among three actors at a time, asking whether a triad forms a balanced or frustrated pattern. It is used to understand how social or political networks organize and change through the mix of positive and negative ties within these triads.",
